<!-- serial numbers -->
<h4 class="close">Serial Numbers and Dates of Manufacture</h4>
<p>The serial number on this model is inscribed on the flat base of the camera body. The H8 REX-4 began production in 1964, starting with S/N 212401, and was introduced in 1965. 
</p>
